{"page":479,"verses":[{"verse_key":"41:21","surah":41,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ لِجُلُودِهِمْ لِمَ شَهِدتُّمْ عَلَيْنَا ۖ قَالُوٓا۟ أَنطَقَنَا ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنطَقَ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ وَهُوَ خَلَقَكُمْ أَوَّلَ مَرَّةٍ وَإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will say to their skins, ‘Why did you testify against us?’ and their skins will reply, ‘God, who gave speech to everything, has given us speech- it was He who created you the first time and to Him you have been returned-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they will say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِجُلُودِهِمْ","en_gloss":"to their skins","transliteration":"lijulūdihim","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِمَ","en_gloss":"Why do","transliteration":"lima","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شَهِدتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you testify","transliteration":"shahidttum","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا ۖ","en_gloss":"against us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They will say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنطَقَنَا","en_gloss":"Allah made us speak","transliteration":"anṭaqanā","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah made us speak","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنطَقَ","en_gloss":"makes speak","transliteration":"anṭaqa","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَلَقَكُمْ","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"41:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوَّلَ","en_gloss":"(the) first","transliteration":"awwala","verse_key":