َـٰسِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the losers","transliteration":"l-khāsirīna","verse_key":"41:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:23"}]},{"verse_key":"41:24","surah":41,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن يَصْبِرُوا۟ فَٱلنَّارُ مَثْوًى لَّهُمْ ۖ وَإِن يَسْتَعْتِبُوا۟ فَمَا هُم مِّنَ ٱلْمُعْتَبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Fire will still be their home, even if they resign themselves to patience, and if they pray to be allowed to make amends, they will not be given permission to do so.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَصْبِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they endure","transliteration":"yaṣbirū","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَٱلنَّارُ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"fal-nāru","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَثْوًۭى","en_gloss":"(is) an abode","transliteration":"mathwan","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَسْتَعْتِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they ask for favor","transliteration":"yastaʿtibū","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"(will be) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُعْتَبِينَ","en_gloss":"those who receive favor","transliteration":"l-muʿ'tabīna","verse_key":"41:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:24"}]},{"verse_key":"41:25","surah":41,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَقَيَّضْنَا لَهُمْ قُرَنَآءَ فَزَيَّنُوا۟ لَهُم مَّا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ وَحَقَّ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقَوْلُ فِىٓ أُمَمٍ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِهِم مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have appointed, for the disbelievers, companions who make their past and present seem fair and right to them, but the sentence has already been passed on them, along with generations of jinn and men before them: they were losers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَقَيَّضْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have destined","transliteration":"waqayyaḍnā","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُرَنَآءَ","en_gloss":"companions","transliteration":"quranāa","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَزَيَّنُوا۟","en_gloss":"(who) made fair-seeming","transliteration":"fazayyanū","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(was) before them","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"(was) before them","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلْفَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(was) behind them","transliteration":"khalfahum","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَحَقَّ","en_gloss":"and (is) justified","transliteration":"waḥaqqa","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","en_gloss":"the Word","transliteration":"l-qawlu","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُمَمٍۢ","en_gloss":"nations","transliteration":"umamin","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"(that have) passed away","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":17,"ar":"خَلَتْ","en_gloss":"(that have) passed away","transliteration":"khalat","verse_key":"41:25"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before t